cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the paper
  it accompanies.
title: "scgraph: stochastic contact graphs and SLA-aware DTN routing under uncertainty"
abstract: >-
  Companion library for "Stochastic Contact Graphs: Rethinking the Contact Plan
  for the 6G Space-Air-Ground Continuum". Generalises the DTN contact plan so
  that each contact carries a joint law over start time, end time and capacity,
  and formulates routing as a chance-constrained deliver-by-deadline problem.
  Implements the store-carry-forward arrival recursion, Monte-Carlo and analytic
  quantile evaluation, correlation-aware replication, the Bernoulli-TEG
  projection used for the subsumption ablation, and three planning-plane
  placements. Its deterministic router is checked against the A-SABR framework
  on point-mass graphs.
